    "type_designations": ["Enterprise 9000", "Enterprise 9100", "9000X", "Citadel"],
    "description": "Huntleigh Healthcare Enterprise 9000, Enterprise 9100, 9000X and Citadel hospital beds incorporating a Class III, mains operated, self-indicating Non-Automatic Weighing Instrument. Main features: hospital bed with contour control and weighing functions; four load cells; safety sides incorporating attendant controls including weighing control buttons; identical weight displays and associated control buttons on both sides of the bed. Devices: semi-automatic zero setting device; verification scale interval 0.5 kg, but with extended indicating device temporarily giving interval of 0.1 kg; BED EXIT alarm function if weight decreases to 50% or less; AUTO-COMP function allowing the weight to be held steady while equipment is added."
